cff-version: 1.2.0
title: slabx-lh2
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both it and the SLAB model it extends.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: Ugwiyeon
    email: lyullee@kgs.or.kr
    affiliation: Korea Gas Safety Corporation
repository-code: "https://github.com/lyullee/slabx-lh2"
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.22075011
    description: Concept DOI for all slabx-lh2 releases
abstract: >-
  Liquid-hydrogen source, thermodynamic and diagnostic extensions to the SLABx
  dense-gas dispersion model. The package includes an explicit resolved-cloud
  handoff that conserves mixture flux while keeping emitted H2 and entrained
  carrier inventories separate for finite-release plume-to-puff transitions.
  A frozen seven-test FFI research evaluation reports concentration and safety
  threshold performance without sensor fitting, residual correction or hull
  assimilation, while retaining unresolved field-structure limitations.
